## Annual Cost Projection

### Year 1 Total Cost
- **Monthly Average**: $7,114
- **Annual Total**: $85,368
- **Setup Costs**: $2,500 (one-time)
- **Total Year 1**: $87,868

### Cost Optimization Opportunities

#### Reserved Instances (Savings: 20-40%)
- **AKS Nodes**: 1-year reservation saves 20%
- **VM Scale Sets**: 3-year reservation saves 40%
- **Potential Annual Savings**: $17,000

#### Storage Optimization (Savings: 10-50%)
- **Storage Tiering**: Move cold data to cool/archive
- **Lifecycle Policies**: Automated data movement
- **Potential Annual Savings**: $4,000

#### Networking Optimization (Savings: 5-15%)
- **ExpressRoute**: Negotiate better rates for high bandwidth
- **VPN**: Use site-to-site instead of point-to-site where possible
- **Potential Annual Savings**: $5,000

### Optimized Annual Cost
- **Base Cost**: $85,368
- **Optimizations**: -$26,000
- **Optimized Annual**: $59,368
- **Monthly Average**: $4,947

## Cost Monitoring & Alerting

### Azure Cost Management
```bash
# Set up budget alerts
az consumption budget create \
  --name "enterprise-budget" \
  --amount 8000 \
  --time-grain Monthly \
  --start-date 2024-01-01 \
  --end-date 2024-12-31
```

### Cost Analysis Queries
```kql
// Top cost by resource group
AzureConsumption
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize TotalCost = sum(Cost) by ResourceGroup
| order by TotalCost desc

// Cost by service
AzureConsumption
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| summarize TotalCost = sum(Cost) by ServiceName
| order by TotalCost desc

// Daily spending trend
AzureConsumption
| where TimeGenerated > ago(90d)
| summarize DailyCost = sum(Cost) by bin(TimeGenerated, 1d)
| render timechart
```

## Scaling Cost Impact

### Horizontal Scaling
- **Additional AKS Nodes**: +$800/month per 3 nodes
- **Extra Storage**: +$10/month per TB
- **New Spoke**: +$3,161/month

### Vertical Scaling
- **Larger VM Sizes**: +20-50% compute costs
- **Higher Storage Performance**: +2-5x storage costs
- **Premium Networking**: +50% network costs

## Cost Control Measures

### Budget Management
- **Monthly Budget**: $8,000 with 80% alert threshold
- **Department Allocation**: Track costs by team/project
- **Resource Tagging**: Mandatory tagging for cost tracking

### Automated Cost Controls
- **Auto-shutdown**: Development environments (weekdays 6 PM)
- **Scaling Policies**: Scale down during off-hours
- **Quota Management**: Prevent resource over-provisioning

### Cost Review Process
- **Weekly Review**: Monitor spending trends
- **Monthly Analysis**: Identify optimization opportunities
- **Quarterly Planning**: Adjust budgets and forecasts

## Financial Responsibility

### Cost Center Allocation
- **Infrastructure**: 60% (hub and networking)
- **Application**: 30% (AKS, App Gateway)
- **Security**: 5% (monitoring, compliance)
- **Management**: 5% (automation, tooling)

### Chargeback Model
- **Business Units**: Pay for their spoke resources
- **Shared Services**: Pro-rated hub costs
- **Overhead**: Management and security costs

